   "type": "pub-hero",
   "title": "如何“hygge”：腾出时间享受生活点滴",
   "texts": [
    "看人来人往。",
    "<p>每个人都在谈论&ldquo;hygge&rdquo;，在丹麦语中，&ldquo;hygge&rdquo;的意思是腾出时间，花点心思让简单的事情变得与众不同。但是如何才能打造&ldquo;hygge&rdquo;氛围呢？我们将向你展示在家享受&ldquo;hygge&rdquo;时光到底有多简单。</p>",
    "如何“hygge”：腾出时间享受生活点滴",
    "normal"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/66/54/6654ef8aa699906c5d34e5eb4cd1b87f.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/66/54/6654ef8aa699906c5d34e5eb4cd1b87f.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "抽点时间，发挥创意。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "10299231"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/1d/8d/1d8d60da5c7026b7fe04f29c39c613be.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/1d/8d/1d8d60da5c7026b7fe04f29c39c613be.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>发挥你的创意&nbsp;</strong>放下日常生活的压力，释放你的创造力。给自己准备好颜料、纸和一个小时的时间&mdash;&mdash;记住，最终的结果并不重要！</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "邀请朋友品尝咖啡和蛋糕。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "70353079"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/16/8a/168ab6c5692db5fc24e38e057ab90c90.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/16/8a/168ab6c5692db5fc24e38e057ab90c90.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>和好友分享美食&nbsp;</strong>朋友和美食都是生命中最简单美好的存在，将两者结合就能轻松获得&ldquo;hygge&rdquo;的感觉了。邀请朋友来家中品尝咖啡和蛋糕，远离咖啡厅里人群的纷扰，你们才能真正享受彼此陪伴的时光。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "在家中选择舒适的一角。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "70320098"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/4b/fa/4bfab2a96a118f02297db3405a7af495.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/4b/fa/4bfab2a96a118f02297db3405a7af495.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>选择一个享受独处时光的地点&nbsp;</strong>冥想并不适合每一个人，但是我们可以偶尔享受一段安静的独处时光。选择一个舒适的独处角落，这样每当你想抽出时间放松的时候就可以待在那里。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "学习一项新技能，自己动手制作一些东西。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "50309860"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/d3/86/d386ffd238434488a2e7c96c0fb12e45.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/d3/86/d386ffd238434488a2e7c96c0fb12e45.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>亲自动手制作一些物件&nbsp;</strong>做手工是放慢生活节奏并集中注意力的好方法。学会一项新技能会让你拥有成就感，每当你使用自己亲手制作的东西时，你就会有一点&ldquo;hygge&rdquo;的感觉。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "喝杯咖啡，休息一下。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/f0/85/f0854cb074150d780f88a69ce0b815ba.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/f0/85/f0854cb074150d780f88a69ce0b815ba.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>休息一下，喝杯咖啡&nbsp;</strong>将喝茶或喝咖啡当作一种放松，而不是行色匆忙地喝完就走。掌握瑞典咖啡休息时间（fika）的艺术，坐下来喝杯咖啡，让忙碌了一上午的你提神放松一下。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "让电影之夜成为一种享受。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e3/6a/e36a2fea06bd74a198508e7a52a2ed58.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e3/6a/e36a2fea06bd74a198508e7a52a2ed58.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>让简单的事情变得与众不同&nbsp;</strong>&ldquo;Hygge&rdquo;就是让你的感官充分享受每一个瞬间。如果你每周五晚上都要看电影，准备一些爱吃的零食，伴着舒缓柔和的烛光，蜷缩在靠垫上，让电影之夜变成一种享受而不是例行公事。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "打造一个梳妆台。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/74/a5/74a50fa4efd19f8f254f6bf150370f93.jpg"
